  ↓
Surface expansion
  ↓
6-cone presentation

The earlier implementation/transition choreography made those changes appear visually harsh.

The important fix was therefore not to disable the underlying state transitions.

It was to make the visual transition behave correctly and smoothly.

And that has now been confirmed by the observed behavior.

